stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> QUEUED: reserve capacity
    QUEUED --> LEASED: current fence assigned
    QUEUED --> CANCELLED: stop before launch
    LEASED --> RUNNING: supervised startup
    LEASED --> FAILED: launch error
    LEASED --> EXPIRED: lease expiry
    LEASED --> CANCELLED: cancel before startup
    RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED: accept outcome and settle
    RUNNING --> FAILED: typed failure and settlement
    RUNNING --> CANCELLED: teardown and settlement
    RUNNING --> EXPIRED: fence and reconcile
    SUCCEEDED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
